# Title: New Root or CA or AuthRoot Certificate to Store
# ID: d223b46b-5621-4037-88fe-fda32eead684
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-04-04
# Tags: attack.impact, attack.t1490
# Description: Detects the addition of new root, CA or AuthRoot certificates to the Windows registry
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\SystemCertificates\\Root\\Certificates\\* OR registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\SystemCertificates\\Root\\Certificates\\* OR registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\EnterpriseCertificates\\Root\\Certificates\\* OR registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\SystemCertificates\\CA\\Certificates\\* OR registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\SystemCertificates\\CA\\Certificates\\* OR registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\EnterpriseCertificates\\CA\\Certificates\\* OR registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\SystemCertificates\\AuthRoot\\Certificates\\* OR registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\SystemCertificates\\AuthRoot\\Certificates\\* OR registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\EnterpriseCertificates\\AuthRoot\\Certificates\\*) AND registry.path:*\\Blob AND registry.data.strings:"Binary Data")
